                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "For nearly 40 years, progress in sickle cell treatment was almost stagnant. To raise awareness, I joined with @RepDannyDavis and @RepBuddyCarter to introduce a resolution to designate September as #SickleCellAwarenessMonth.",
